{"strongs": "H2885", "word": "טַבַּ֫עַת", "translit": "tab.ba.at", "root": "טבל", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "signet, signet-ring, ring", "definition": "טַבַּ֫עַת noun feminine signet, signet-ring, ring (on formation see Lag BN 88 ; Assyrian ‰imbu°u , seal-ring , Muss-Arn l.c .) — absolute טַבַּעַת Exod 26:24 + 3 t.; construct id. Esth 3:12 + 3 t.; טַבַּעְתּוֺ Gen 41:42 + 2 t.; plural absolute טַבָּעוֺת Isa 3:1 ; Exod 28:23 טַבָּעֹת Exod 25:12 (twice in verse) + 14 t. construct טַבְּעוֺת Exod 28:23 + 2 t.; טַבְּעֹת Exod 25:12 + 12 t.; suffix טַבְּעֹתָ֯ו Exod 28:28 ; Exod 39:21 טַבְּעֹתֵיהֶם Exod 26:29 טַבְּעֹתָם Exod 36:34 — \\ \\ l. signet-ring , of king, taken from his hand and given as token of authority Gen 41:42 ( E ), Esth 3:10 ; Esth 8:2 used in sealing official missives Esth 3:12 ; Esth 8:8 (twice in verse); Esth 8:10 (verb חָתַם ). 2. ring , as ornament Isa 3:21 as gift for sacred purposed Exod 35:22 ; Num 31:50 (both P ). 3. most often (only in Exodus) of rings for staves of ark, for curtains, for ephod, and other sacred furniture Exod 25:12 (3 t. in verse) + 35 t. in Exodus (all P ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3292')\">BDB3292</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2885')\">H2885</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3291')\">BDB3291</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3293')\">BDB3293</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>טַבַּ֫עַת</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>signet, signet-ring, ring</highlightword> (on formation see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 88</sup></lookup>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>‰imbu°u</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>seal-ring</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('M-A')\">Muss-Arn<sup>l.c</sup></lookup>.) — absolute <bdbheb>טַבַּעַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 26:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,24)\">Exod 26:24</ref> + 3 t.; construct <highlight>id.</highlight> <re